{
	"name": "Meadow Retreat",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/tree-roots-glow-yellow.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When you reach 14th level, you find yourself grounded in the meadow like the deep roots of the grasses that sway in the wind. Through a series of rituals and dances requiring 8 hours of uninterrupted work, you can designate a meadow as your retreat. If you or your allies complete a short rest in your meadow retreat, when you roll hit dice you gain the maximum amount of hit points.</p><p>Additionally, so long as you are on the same plane of existence as your retreat, you may use an action to teleport yourself and up to 5 willing creatures within 30 feet of you to your meadow retreat. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a long rest.</p>",
